 "description": "The Moog ladder as Antti Huovilainen modelled it: four saturating transistor stages with the feedback taken half a sample late, run at twice the sample rate, so it drives, squelches and self-oscillates like the real one. An LFO (free or in time with the song) and an envelope follower move the cutoff",
